  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sunny, Oct 2021, HOM Fund Support provision of food and hygiene kitsfor destitude mothers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project Food items and hygiene kits provision to KORIE SEFER destitute mothers. is implemented by the Sunny Future Humanitarian Association.  The project targets approx. 160 destitute mothers over a three month period in a particularly poor section of the Nifas Silk Lafto area in District 2 in Addis Ababa.  The project will provide food items and hygiene for women identified as being particularly vulnerable to and affected by the C-19 and economic shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
